{"id":"wb-3-52","name":"通天岩石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"通天岩 (赣州)","text":"通天岩位于中国江西省赣州市章贡区水西镇，属丹霞地貌景区，有三个山坳和四条山脊、十多处窟洞，主要有忘归岩、同心岩、通天岩、翠微岩等。通天岩景区共有石龛279座、造像359尊，是中国南方石窟造像较为集中的地方。除翠微岩几尊立佛为唐代外，其它多为宋代所刻。通天岩石窟于1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%80%9A%E5%A4%A9%E5%B2%A9_(%E8%B5%A3%E5%B7%9E)","revisionId":92186657,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92186657","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f0d821ee9a4b94b8a3027781.jpg","title":"Tongtianyan_Grottoes.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tongtianyan_Grottoes.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/Tongtianyan_Grottoes.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Underbar dk","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Tongtianyan Grottoes (通天岩石窟), Ganzhou, Jiangxi","width":320,"height":240}}